# Tims Hockey Challenge. Bluehost cron is MST and may ignore CRON_TZ.
# job/cron_run.sh reads America/Toronto itself. It never submits a pick.
#
# */5 hits every snapshot slot on the minute, and minute 00 or 05 is the
# morning retry. */30 also hits the slots; the :00 run is that hour's
# morning retry. Do not install both.
#
# Morning slate: 03:00 through 13:59 America/Toronto, once an hour, until
# today is graded or partial. Pending still runs. Exit 75 retries next hour.
#
# List checks (America/Toronto), including after the morning slate is up.
# 12:30 through 22:00 are all on the hour or the half hour:
#   00:00 03:00
#   12:30 13:00 14:00 15:00 15:30 16:00 17:00
#   18:00 18:30 19:00 19:30 20:00 20:30 21:00 21:30 22:00
#
# Create the log directory once: mkdir -p "$HOME/tims-hockey/logs"
# Make the wrapper executable: chmod +x "$HOME/tims-hockey/job/cron_run.sh"

*/5 * * * * $HOME/tims-hockey/job/cron_run.sh
